<h1 id="toc0"><span>From the Office of the Ethics Committee</span></h1>
<h3 id="toc1"><span>Draft and review packet for document SCP-5236</span></h3>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<div style="text-align: center;">
<h4 id="toc2"><span><span style="color: #990011">SEALED</span> to the Ethics Committee under Article III of the Foundational Mandate</span></h4>
<h2 id="toc3"><span><span style="color: #990011">Level-E5 clearance required for access</span></span></h2>
<h5 id="toc4"><span>Level-O5 clearance may be accepted by petition on a case-by-case basis.</span></h5>
</div>
